.TH EPUB2M4B 1 "September 2026" "epub2m4b 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
epub2m4b \- turn EPUB ebooks into chaptered M4B audiobooks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B epub2m4b
.RI [ \-\-version ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B epub2m4b
is a mouse-driven terminal application that converts EPUB ebooks into
resumable, chaptered M4B audiobooks.
.PP
On first launch the app guides you through choosing the folder that contains
your EPUB books, a folder for temporary narration audio, and a bundled
narration voice. Narration uses an OpenAI API key that you can save or change
later from the in-app Settings screen; keys are stored in the system keyring.
.PP
Before any paid narration starts, the app shows a cost estimate and requires
typing a confirmation word. Generation can be paused, resumed, and cancelled
at safe boundaries, and completed audiobooks are opened with the desktop
player from the job screen.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/epub2m4b/config.toml
User configuration.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/epub2m4b/jobs
Persisted job manifests and progress.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ffmpeg (1),
.BR xdg\-open (1)
